nding the Mastermind visibly upgrades him, which is what makes ascension feel like something instead of a stat bump.",jL="sprite -> /mc-sprites/{sheet}_t{tier}.png (512x512, framed to match the 48 hero sprites exactly, so the MC shares the battle canvas anchor and weapon-grip metrics). portrait -> /mc-portraits/{sheet}_t{tier}.png (1024x1024, for the select screen).",FL=[{id:"borrowed_light",title:"The Borrowed Light",recommended:!0,theme:"dark gold · black hair · a cracked gold ring",incarnations:{male:{name:"Ardan",sheet:"mc8"},female:{name:"Ilvaine",sheet:"mc4"}},weapon:"Sword",weapon_class:"Sword",stat_bias:{STR:2,VIT:2,AGI:1},story:"You were not the strongest of the young gods. You were the one who asked why the mortals were left to it. So the elders gave you exactly what you asked for: a world, a body that bleeds, and no power that you have not earned from the ground up. The light in your halo is not yours. It is a loan, and it is being counted.",personality:{core:"Earnest, stubborn, and privately terrified of getting people killed — which is precisely why he does.",traits:["Earnest","Stubborn","Self-doubting in private, decisive in the moment","Dry, deflecting humour","Furious at unfairness"],how_they_see_heroes:"As PEOPLE, not pieces. Learns their names, remembers their dead. This is the whole reason losing one hurts.",under_pressure:"Goes very calm and very quiet, then does the reckless thing anyway.",flaw:"Takes every death personally, and will spend himself to avoid one — which is how you lose the whole party.",speech:"Plain, warm, a little clipped. Deflects praise with a joke. Swears when it goes wrong. Never grandiose — he is embarrassed by the halo."},voice:{_arrival:"THE FIRST WORDS ON THE GROUND (2026-10-03): played right after the HEAVEN INTRO (HeavenIntro.tsx), where the One Above gives the task — five days, five floors — and opens the floor under the god mid-sentence. These lines land the fall: a beat of pain, a beat of grievance at being thrown, 